{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🧠🤖 第二周-Day6 ⚡ QLoRA微调实战\n",
    "\n",
    "今天我们要用最前沿的unsloth库，在RTX 4060Ti上对Qwen2-0.5B进行QLoRA微调！这可是大模型开发的核心技能！🚀\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🎯 任务目标\n",
    "在4060Ti上用unsloth对Qwen2-0.5B做QLoRA微调，跑通完整微调流程，理解超参数影响"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📦 环境准备\n",
    "\n",
    "我们先安装必要的库，unsloth是微调神器，支持低内存占用和超快的训练速度！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install unsloth[cu118] --upgrade --no-cache-dir\n",
    "!pip install datasets trl peft bitsandbytes"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🤖 加载模型和tokenizer\n",
    "\n",
    "unsloth的load_model超级方便，自动适配低内存环境！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import torch\n",
    "from datasets import load_dataset\n",
    "from unsloth import FastLanguageModel\n",
    "from unsloth.chat_templates import get_chat_template\n",
    "\n",
    "# 4bit量化加载\n",
    "model, tokenizer = FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(\n",
    "    model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen2-0.5B-Instruct\",\n",
    "    max_seq_length=2048,\n",
    "    dtype=None,  # 自动选择dtype\n",
    "    load_in_4bit=True,  # 4bit量化\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ 模型加载成功！\")\n",
    "print(f\"模型参数量：{model.num_parameters()/1e9:.2f}亿\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🎛️ 配置LoRA\n",
    "\n",
    "QLoRA的核心是4bit量化+LoRA适配器，大幅降低内存需求！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from unsloth import FastLlamaModel\n",
    "model = FastLlamaModel.get_peft_model(\n",
    "    model,\n",
    "    r=16,  # LoRA rank，决定适配器容量\n",
    "    target_modules=[\"q_proj\", \"k_proj\", \"v_proj\", \"o_proj\", \"gate_proj\", \"up_proj\", \"down_proj\"],\n",
    "    lora_alpha=32,  # 缩放因子\n",
    "    lora_dropout=0.05,  # Dropout比例\n",
    "    bias=\"none\",\n",
    "    use_gradient_checkpointing=\"unsloth\",  # 梯度检查点\n",
    "    random_state=3407,\n",
    "    use_rslora=False,  # 是否使用RSLoRA\n",
    "    loftq_config=None,  # 是否使用LoFTQ\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ LoRA配置完成！\")\n",
    "print(f\"可训练参数：{sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters() if p.requires_grad)/1e6:.1f}M\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📝 创建指令数据集\n",
    "\n",
    "我们创建一个关于"糖水店记账"的小型指令数据集，这是Jason的实际业务需求！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 创建糖水店记账指令数据\n",
    "instruction_data = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"今天卖了哪些商品\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"今天主要销售了：红豆沙、绿豆沙、西米露、烧仙草、银耳羹，还有奶茶饮料系列。\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"今天的总营业额是多少\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"今天的总营业额为1286元，其中现金收入426元，微信支付660元，支付宝支付200元。\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"今天的主要原材料成本\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"今天的原材料成本约458元，主要包括红豆30元、绿豆25元、西米15元、牛奶80元、糖浆25元等。\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"哪些是热销产品\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"热销产品前三名：红豆沙（销量35杯）、西米露（销量28杯）、烧仙草（销量22杯）\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"今天的毛利率是多少\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"毛利率 = (营业额-成本)/营业额 = (1286-458)/1286 ≈ 64.4%，符合糖水店正常水平。\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"如何统计微信支付收入\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"通过微信商家后台导出今日流水，筛选"已完成"状态的订单，汇总金额即可。记得扣除退款金额。\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"盘点库存的建议\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"建议每周末全面盘点，每日核对高周转物料（糖浆、珍珠、水果）。重点记录保质期，先进先出。\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"顾客退款如何处理\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"记录退款原因（口味/温度/其他），退款方式需与支付方式一致。每日统计退款率，异常及时改进。\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"如何优化原料采购\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"根据历史销售预测采购，考虑季节因素（夏季冷饮需求上升）。与供应商谈月结降低成本，建立安全库存。\"\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"instruction\": \"会员优惠方案\",\n",
    "        \"input\": \"\",\n",
    "        \"output\": \"推出充值优惠：充100送20，充200送50。生日当月8折。老客户积分兑换，积分1元=10积分。\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"✅ 创建了{len(instruction_data)}条指令数据\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 转换为dataset格式\n",
    "from datasets import Dataset\n",
    "dataset = Dataset.from_list(instruction_data)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 查看数据格式\n",
    "print(\"📋 数据样例：\")\n",
    "print(dataset[0])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🔄 格式化数据\n",
    "\n",
    "使用unsloth的chat template将数据格式化成训练格式！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 获取chat template\n",
    "tokenizer = get_chat_template(tokenizer, chat_template=\"qwen\")\n",
    "\n",
    "def format_chat_template(example):\n",
    "    \"\"\"格式化数据为chat格式\"\"\"\n",
    "    messages = [\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"你是一个专业的糖水店记账助手，擅长帮助店主整理账目、分析销售数据、优化成本管理。\"},\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": f\"{example['instruction']} {example['input']}\"},\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": example['output']}\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 应用chat template\n",
    "    text = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(messages, tokenize=False)\n",
    "    return {\"text\": text}\n",
    "\n",
    "# 格式化数据\n",
    "dataset = dataset.map(format_chat_template)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ 数据格式化完成！\")\n",
    "print(\"📝 格式化后的数据样例：\")\n",
    "print(dataset[0]['text'][:500] + \"...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🎮 开始训练！\n",
    "\n",
    "使用SFTTrainer开始微调，unsloth支持超长上下文和高效训练！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from unsloth import UnslothTrainer\n",
    "from transformers import TrainingArguments\n",
    "\n",
    "# 配置训练参数\n",
    "training_args = TrainingArguments(\n",
    "    per_device_train_batch_size=2,  # 每设备批次大小\n",
    "    gradient_accumulation_steps=4,  # 梯度累积\n",
    "    warmup_steps=10,  # 预热步数\n",
    "    max_steps=50,  # 最大训练步数（为了演示用较少步数）\n",
    "    learning_rate=2e-4,  # 学习率\n",
    "    fp16=not torch.cuda.is_bf16_supported(),  # 使用FP16\n",
          bf16=torch.cuda.is_bf16_supported(),  # 使用BF16（如果支持）\n",
    "    logging_steps=5,  # 每5步记录一次日志\n",
    "    optim=\"adamw_8bit\",  # 8bit优化器\n",
    "    weight_decay=0.01,  # 权重衰减\n",
    "    lr_scheduler_type=\"linear\",  # 线性学习率调度\n",
    "    seed=3407,\n",
    "    output_dir=\"./qlora_output\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建trainer\n",
    "trainer = UnslothTrainer(\n",
    "    model=model,\n",
    "    tokenizer=tokenizer,\n",
    "    train_dataset=dataset,\n",
    "    dataset_text_field=\"text\",\n",
    "    max_seq_length=2048,\n",
    "    data_args=training_args,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ Trainer创建完成！准备开始训练...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 开始训练！\n",
    "print(\"🚀 开始训练...\")\n",
    "trainer.train()\n",
    "print(\"✅ 训练完成！\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 保存模型\n",
    "trainer.save_model(\"./qwen2-0.5B-qlora-sugar\")\n",
    "tokenizer.save_pretrained(\"./qwen2-0.5B-qlora-sugar\")\n",
    "print(\"💾 模型已保存到 ./qwen2-0.5B-qlora-sugar\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🧪 测试微调效果\n",
    "\n",
    "测试微调前后的模型回答对比，看看我们的糖水店记账助手效果如何！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def test_model(model, tokenizer, prompt):\n",
    "    \"\"\"测试模型回答\"\"\"\n",
    "    messages = [\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"你是一个专业的糖水店记账助手，擅长帮助店主整理账目、分析销售数据、优化成本管理。\"},\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": prompt}\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    inputs = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(messages, return_tensors=\"pt\").to(\"cuda\")\n",
    "    outputs = model.generate(inputs, max_new_tokens=256, temperature=0.7, do_sample=True)\n",
    "    response = tokenizer.decode(outputs[0], skip_special_tokens=True)\n",
    "    return response"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 加载微调后的模型\n",
    "from unsloth import FastLanguageModel\n",
    "model, tokenizer = FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(\n",
    "    \"./qwen2-0.5B-qlora-sugar\",\n",
    "    max_seq_length=2048,\n",
    "    dtype=None,\n",
    "    load_in_4bit=True,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ 微调模型加载完成！\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 测试问题\n",
    "test_prompts = [\n",
    "    \"今天总营业额多少\",\n",
    "    \"热销产品有哪些\",\n",
    "    \"如何优化原料采购\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"🧪 微调后模型测试：\")\n",
    "for prompt in test_prompts:\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n📝 问题：{prompt}\")\n",
    "    response = test_model(model, tokenizer, prompt)\n",
    "    # 提取回答部分\n",
    "    response = response.split(\"<|im_end|>\")[-1] if \"<|im_end|>\" in response else response\n",
    "    print(f\"💬 回答：{response.strip()}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📊 训练效果分析\n",
    "\n",
    "分析训练过程中的一些关键指标，理解超参数的影响！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "# 假设我们记录了训练损失（实际使用时从trainer.state.log_history获取）\n",
    "steps = list(range(0, 50, 5))\n",
    "loss_values = [2.5, 2.1, 1.8, 1.6, 1.4, 1.2, 1.0, 0.9, 0.8, 0.7]\n",
    "\n",
    "# 绘制训练曲线\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
    "plt.plot(steps, loss_values, 'b-o', linewidth=2, markersize=6)\n",
    "plt.xlabel('训练步数', fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.ylabel('损失值', fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.title('QLoRA训练损失曲线', fontsize=14)\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"📈 训练分析：\")\n",
    "print(f\"• 初始损失：{loss_values[0]:.2f} → 最终损失：{loss_values[-1]:.2f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"• 损失下降：{((loss_values[0]-loss_values[-1])/loss_values[0]*100):.1f}%\")\n",
    "print(f\"• 平均每步下降：{(loss_values[0]-loss_values[-1])/len(loss_values):.3f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🎛️ 超参数影响分析\n",
    "\n",
    "我们来看看关键超参数对微调效果的影响！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
