    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n💡 当前配置：\")\n",
    "print(f\"   • LoRA Rank: 16\")\n",
    "print(f\"   • LoRA Alpha: 32\")\n",
    "print(f\"   • Learning Rate: 2e-4\")\n",
    "print(f\"   • Batch Size: 2\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🎯 总结与思考\n",
    "\n",
    "恭喜！你已经完成了QLoRA微调的完整流程！让我们总结一下关键点："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 训练统计信息\n",
    "training_stats = {\n",
